==English==
{{was wotd|2023|February|2}}

===Etymology===
The {{glossary|verb}} is derived from {{prefix|en|retro|pos1={{glossary|prefix}} meaning ‘back; backward’|fit|t2=to equip, supply}}.<ref>Compare {{R:OED Online|pos=v|id=164504|date=March 2022|nodot=1}}; {{R:Lexico|pos=v}}</ref>

The {{glossary|noun}}, which is first attested later than the verb, is either derived:<ref>{{R:OED Online|pos=n|id=164503|date=March 2022|nodot=1}}; {{R:Lexico|pos=n}}</ref>
* from the verb (see above); or
* from {{prefix|en|retro|fit|t2=act of fitting; conformity of elements one to another}}.

